<title>ESTONIA: Estonia cen.bank foreign reserves fall in October.</title>
<headline>Estonia cen.bank foreign reserves fall in October.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's central bank said on Tuesday its gold and foreign reserves fell to 7.26 billion kroons at end-October from 7.28 billion a month earlier.</p>
<p>    ESTONIA RESERVES (bln kroon)  Oct 96   Sept 96   Oct 95</p>
<p>    Gold/foreign reserves	    7.26     7.28	N/A</p>
<p>    Foreign currency assets	  7.22     7.24	N/A</p>
<p>    Cen.bank assets		    8.35     8.37	N/A</p>
<p>    Notes/coins in circulation     4.68     4.69	N/A</p>
<p>Note - The bank said the fall in foreign currency assets was linked to a fall in base money at end-month, which was due to technical movements related to banks' reserve requirements.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
